sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as ZoneTalk UI (React)
    participant Store as localStorage/sessionStorage
    participant Zone as Zone Engine
    participant Media as Browser Media APIs

    User->>UI: Open app
    UI->>Store: Load cached conversations/messages
    UI-->>User: Show Chats view

    User->>UI: Switch to Zone tab
    UI->>Zone: Generate nearby people (coffee/ride)
    Zone-->>UI: People list + positions
    UI-->>User: Show radar or car seat map

    User->>UI: Select nearest person
    UI->>Store: Load/create direct thread
    UI-->>User: Open nearest-person chat

    User->>UI: Click Message everyone here
    UI->>Store: Load/create zone broadcast thread
    UI-->>User: Open broadcast conversation

    User->>UI: Type message + Send
    UI->>Store: Persist message with timestamp
    UI-->>User: Render message bubble

    UI->>UI: Trigger auto-reply timer
    UI->>Store: Persist simulated reply
    UI-->>User: Show new reply

    User->>UI: Open emoji picker and insert emoji
    UI-->>User: Updated input text

    User->>UI: Toggle voice note recording
    UI->>Media: Request microphone access
    Media-->>UI: Granted/Denied
    UI-->>User: Record audio or show warning
